Sukumo's change to fontique 0.11.1 as crates.io publishes it (../README.md):
each generic family found when first asked for, and a query's generic
families and script fallbacks found when matching reaches them.
Apply with: patch -p1 -d fontique < fontique/SUKUMO-PATCH.patch

